  "name": "semantic-scholar-fastmcp-mcp-server",
  "description": "A FastMCP-based server providing comprehensive integration with the Semantic Scholar Academic Graph API for large-scale paper discovery and citation analysis. The system implements a robust rate-limiting engine to handle both authenticated and unauthenticated requests across graph and recommendation endpoints. It features a modular architecture that includes a dedicated HTTP bridge for exposing academic data via a minimal REST surface.",
